        steps: ['Up positive: y₀ = 0, v₀ = 0, a = −9.8 m/s², Δy = −45 m.', '−45 = −4.9t² → t² = 9.18 → t = 3.03 s.', 'v = 0 − 9.8(3.03) = −29.7 m/s.', 'Check: v² = 2gh = 2(9.8)(45) = 882 → |v| = 29.7 m/s ✓.'],
        answer: 't ≈ 3.0 s; v ≈ 30 m/s downward',
